    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slay monsters and level up. Create a unique build for your play style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/471d71cb34579dfbd3d692bf2eeef260.poster.avif?t=1750476245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/471d71cb34579dfbd3d692bf2eeef260.webm?t=1750476245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/471d71cb34579dfbd3d692bf2eeef260.mp4?t=1750476245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brew potions with exotic ingredients to give you the edge in battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/93673d3a3a2893bff1a28942f72beea1.poster.avif?t=1750476245\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/93673d3a3a2893bff1a28942f72beea1.webm?t=1750476245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/93673d3a3a2893bff1a28942f72beea1.mp4?t=1750476245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tune the difficulty at any Checkpoint with the Mortal's Halo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090130/extras/bea2172b6ee36504168591fe10f6b053.poste